{"data":{"body":"[P2] Keep service operation identity independent of SDK snapshots\n\nFor an unnamed root operation whose service events omit `Name` and `ParentId`, these fallbacks copy both fields from the SDK checkpoint snapshot. `replay.before` reads that same snapshot, so a corrupted name or parent can compare equal to itself and pass the replay identity check. Normalize service-side absence independently to null, without consulting SDK snapshots, and add a regression with conflicting checkpoint identity.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABEbyCmA","finding_digest":"b77681ba9a94e104e5ef401d78df2ade48471162ef20702875b02cd209756773","finding_id":"arf_v1_w53idou2stqqjzppiaoxrxzk3z","finding_key":"lmi/source_evidence.py::casesources.histories::service-output-independence","identity_key":"lmi/source_evidence.py::casesources.histories::service-output-independence","line":186,"observation_digest":"1cb270fe66560256e548bea0180b3bb1e8f36187faa57212bf22f12de6f71f61","observation_id":"aro_v1_dszhb7tgkybfnzkix2qbqcz3wh","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/lmi/source_evidence.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_w53idou2stqqjzppiaoxrxzk3z","published_at":"2026-11-16T22:30:42Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gitfawrmpthxmt7tw77onot5bu","reviewed_base_sha":"30915949a9f08023f6227357338d3a7cf1495313","reviewed_head_sha":"8c418ae7b5801c2d9fdf71f6124a986f142c3726","reviewer":"codex","start_line":185,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":186},"record_id":"art_v1_rvxol3uon6im7qmdwightjromp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-16T22:30:42Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
